[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0020","text":"……哦，是可丽饼店啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0030","text":"是高中生吧？\n放学回家的路上……大概就是这种感觉吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0040","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0050","text":"……凛世也会\n像那样度过时光吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0055","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0060","text":"可丽饼的话……\n经常和班上的同学们……一起去……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0070","text":"哦，是吗……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0080","text":"呵呵……\n是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0090","text":"学校的放学后……\n事务所的放学后……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_03_0100","text":"凛世的放学后……\n十分奢侈……"}]
